# Project Specification: Project MBM (Milk Before Meat)
## System Architecture, Global Logic, and Phase 1 Implementation Blueprint

---

## 1. Executive Summary & Core Mission
Project MBM is a digital ministering system engineered to counter the spiritual fragmentation and addictive "brain rot" loops of secular social media algorithms. Instead of optimizing for outrage, vanity, or endless consumption, MBM utilizes progressive machine learning to identify a user's current spiritual state, isolate their inherent recognition of goodness (the Light of Christ), and dynamically route them toward deeper spiritual truths. 

Patterned directly after the Savior’s method of meeting individuals exactly where they are—delivering foundational principles ("milk") before introducing advanced structural doctrines ("meat")—the app operates as a private, judgment-free digital gateway. The ultimate, uncompromised objective is to help users recognize that all goodness in the world comes from Jesus Christ, progressively steering them toward the restored gospel and the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints purely through voluntary, pull-based interaction.

---

## 2. Onboarding Architecture: The "Empty State" Initial Fork
When a brand-new user downloads and opens the app, the system collects zero initial profile data and requires no journal entries. It minimizes friction to optimize immediate spiritual hook and data capture.

### Step 1: The Cinematic/Animated Hook
*   **Visual Asset:** A high-impact, clean, loopable animated sequence of the empty tomb.
*   **Text Overlay:** **"He Is Risen."** 
*   **Core Realization:** A universal message establishing that every moment of pure peace, awe, or goodness in human life originates from Him.

### Step 2: The Multi-Choice Segmentation Engine
Immediately following the animation, the user is presented with a single, profound, universally applicable question designed to map their exact lifelong faith orientation.

> **Onboarding Question:** *"How did the very first time you ever heard about Jesus Christ defying death make you feel?"*

The system evaluates the multi-choice selections behind the scenes using a completely hidden backend routing matrix:

| User Selection | Identified Faith Root | Hidden System Feed Assignment |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **"My parents told me it was our God, so I just believed it."** | Cultural/Devoted Christian or Active Latter-day Saint | **The Discipleship/Maintenance Feed** |
| **"I questioned it heavily—it sounded completely impossible."** | Analytical Skeptic, Atheist/Agnostic, or Faith Transition | **The Bridge/Apologetics Feed** |
| **"It gave me a deep sense of peace and hope."** | Spiritually Sensitive Seeker / Mainstream Christian | **The Foundational Light Feed (Milk)** |
| **"I have actually never really thought about it until now."** | Secular / Zero Gospel Exposure | **The Foundational Light Feed (Milk)** |
| **"Other (Tell us in your own words...)"** | Raw Qualitative Text String | **NLP Sentiment Tagging Engine** (Routes dynamically based on text analysis) |

